OL,4,CStar Wars actor 'thrilled' to voice    
OL,5,Cthe Welsh Luke Skywalker               
OL,6,GVoicing Luke Skywalker in the Welsh-   
OL,7,Glanguage version of Star Wars was a    
OL,8,G"dream job" according to actor Osian   
OL,9,GMorgan.                                
OL,11,FThe Cardiff-born actor said he loved   
OL,12,Fthe film series as a child and playing 
OL,13,Fone of the lead roles was "very        
OL,14,Fexciting".                             
OL,16,FStar Wars: Gobaith Newydd - based on   
OL,17,Fthe original 1977 film Star Wars       
OL,18,FEpisode IV: A New Hope - was given its 
OL,19,Ffirst showing at a red-carpet event in 
OL,20,FCardiff on Thursday.                   
